- React Query handles caching, retries, and stale-time management
- 5-minute poll interval (staleTime)
- Error boundary with retry button
- Metric cards + two charts (DAU trend, feature usage)
- Responsive grid layout
- Loading state
- 5s timeout on fetch (AbortSignal.timeout)

